Rain and Storm days."]],[2,["If a non-seasonal-track is playing, and the player enters a seasonal-track area (",["l","鹈鹕镇","Town"]," apart), there will be silence (e.g., entering the ",["l","煤矿森林","Forest"]," from ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Town"]," when the Town theme is playing, exiting the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],", the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"],", the ",["l","法师塔","Wizard's Tower"],"...). Exiting ",["l","树屋","Treehouse"]," makes exception to the rule: the track playing before the entering plays."]]]],["l",0,[[1,["In ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],", music triggering works as follows:"]],[2,["If the seasonal track is playing, it continues playing when entering town."]],[2,["If no track is playing and the player enters ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Town"]," from the ",["l","巴士站","Bus Stop"],", the ",["l","煤矿森林","Forest"]," or ",["l","深山","the Mountain"],", the seasonal track will be triggered if it is before 12 PM. Otherwise, the Town theme will be triggered (given other weather, season and time conditions are met)."]],[2,["If the player enters ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Town"]," from ",["l","沙滩","the Beach"],", ",["l","下水道","the Sewers"],", or by exiting the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],", the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],", ",["l","哈维的诊所","Harvey's Clinic"],", ",["l","Joja超市","JojaMart"],", the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"]," or the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],", the Town theme will be triggered (given the weather, season and time conditions are met). It will also be triggered when exiting any town building if no music was previously playing."]],[2,["The Town theme auto-loops while staying in town or one of its buildings (even after 6 PM, but the track will then abruptly stop at 7 PM if outside and at 8 PM if in a building)."]]]],["l",0,[[1,["The track will not change, nor will be silenced, entering the following locations:"]],[2,["Any interior on ",["l","农场","the Farm"]," (buildings and the ",["l","山洞","cave"],"), ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," entrance, the ",["l","帐篷","Tent"]," and most ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Town"]," houses (",["l","河间大道1号","1 River Road"],", ",["l","柳巷1号","1 Willow Lane"],", ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],", ",["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor's Manor"],", ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"],", ",["l","星之果实酒吧","Stardrop Saloon"]," before 5 PM, ",["l","拖车","Trailer"],")"]],[2,[["l","玛妮的牧场","Marnie's Ranch"]," and ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],". In those, Country Shop triggers on entering only if no music was previously playing."]],[2,[["l","社区中心","Community Center"]," on entering, but the Town theme will play after exiting."]],[2,["The ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"]," entrance, if the previous track is one of the three volcano tracks."]]]],["l",0,[[1,["In ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," and the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", music triggering is dependent of mine level and time since music last played. On floor 2, music will always begin playing. On floors 1, 11, 40, 80, and 120, the game music will stop playing. On floors 31-39, 71-79, 111-119, and floors that are divisible by 5, the game music will continue playing but no new tracks will be played. On all remaining floors, there is a 50% chance to play a new song if it has been at least 2.5 minutes since the last song in the Mines began. Taking the elevator to a different section of the Mines will also cause the game music to stop playing."]]]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["In addition to ConcernedApe's official Bandcamp account, he has at least two other Bandcamp accounts: https://evergreenmultimedia.bandcamp.com/ and a secret account, that he may reveal in \"another decade\"."]]]]]]]}